NAME: known bug: user label named like a generated label
DESCRIPTION: characterization of current output (i-7d2612-425c66); pMARS keeps the first LET1, see behtests/label_collision.beh
SRC:
(let (x 7)
  (seq
    (JMP LET1)
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (label LET1)
    (JMP (Dir 0)) ))
EXPECTED:
